description: "A Ulauncher extension that finds a math symbol by its LaTeX name and copies it to the clipboard."
image: "thumbnail.png"
image-alt: "The Ulauncher window with the query m sigma. The first results are σ with \\sigma and Σ with \\Sigma, each with its Unicode name and code point, and more sigma variants follow."
